## 7. Data-flows checklist

### Evidence gate

- [ ] `## Evidence` section filled with overall status + trace method
- [ ] Every step in every Steps table tagged `[verified]` or `[estimated]`
- [ ] Error paths cite real try/except or middleware (no invented branches)
- [ ] Performance numbers tagged (benchmark `[verified]`, intuition `[estimated]`)
- [ ] >=50% of step references are `[verified]`

### Coverage

- [ ] At least one read flow documented end-to-end
- [ ] Auth flow documented
- [ ] Write flow includes transaction boundary and cache invalidation
- [ ] Background job flow includes retry / dead-letter strategy
- [ ] Each flow has error paths, not just happy path
- [ ] Performance numbers cited from benchmarks (or marked estimated)
- [ ] Every step has file:line reference
- [ ] File committed to `dissects/<system>/deep-dive/data-flows.md`